{
  "slug": "unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code",
  "name": "Unreal Engine Skills For Claude Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Control Unreal Editor directly from Claude Code via MCP. Hundreds of tools exposed via Unreal's ToolsetRegistry across 30+ toolsets: actors, blueprints, materials, Niagara, Control Rigs, Sequencer, State Trees, widgets, Gameplay Ability System, automation testing, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `create-toolset` (Use this skill when authoring or extending an Unreal Engine toolset, a class of static, AI-callable functions registered…), `unreal-mcp` (Use this skill to perform actions inside an Unreal Engine project via a live-editor MCP connection), `unreal-skill` (Use this skill when creating, editing, or reviewing an Unreal Engine Agent Skill, a named bundle of instructions…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code@claude-plugins-official` from `EpicGames/unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
